WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:10.990
It’s project time! Make one or two characters dance in ScratchJr when the green flag is pressed, using a repeat block for the dance moves.

2
00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:13.870
Make one or two characters dance.

3
00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:16.470
Dancers repeat their moves!

4
00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:21.580
Put up, down, right, left inside a repeat block to make a dance.

5
00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.420
Give every dancer a green flag.

6
00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:31.340
Press the flag and they all dance.

7
00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:33.260
Tap the green sound button and add a pop or your own recorded sound.

8
00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:38.330
Dance to the star: up, down, right — 3 times! Use 🔁.

9
00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:41.460
Hop, hop, hop — what a dance!

10
00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:45.980
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

11
00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:49.320
Now plan it, build it, test it, and share it!
